WEBVTT

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:08.800
My energy... Erymanthos' energy from
20,000 jumps will gather in one place.

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:15.520
All the energy will flow into
whichever one of us gives up first.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:22.860
Lecty!

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.860
Run!

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.910
I said, run! Mehitak!

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:39.330
Karkinos!

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:41.670
Age...

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:48.590
<b>Tooku kirameku hoshi ni ikudo mo watashi wa negau</b>

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:54.850
<b>Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story</b>

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:14.910
<b>Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu</b>

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:22.210
<b>Mayakashi demo maboroshi demo naku sakaraenu nagare</b>

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.090
<b>(Kurai)</b>

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:29.260
<b>Yami ni sumishi mamono</b>

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:30.930
<b>(Blight)</b>

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:34.720
<b>Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa</b>

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:36.230
<b>(Eiyuu wo motomu)</b>

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:38.890
<b>Mezame arugamama</b>

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:47.690
<b>Arishi yume ni arasoi wa tsukimono to kami ga iunara</b>

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:52.700
<b>Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for</b>

00:01:52.780 --> 00:02:01.580
<b>Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita kodou wa dare nimo can't stop</b>

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:05.750
<b>Fureau ga sadame</b>

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:31.740
What is this?

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:34.780
What's the matter, Dhianeila-sama?

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:38.290
Age...

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:57.100
Lecty.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:00.770
Lecty! Lecty!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.660
Belcross.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.990
We have almost reached
humanity's homeland, our mother planet!

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:04.210
We have no choice but to move
forward in order to reclaim it!

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:08.460
All of you, there's nothing for
us to be afraid of any longer!

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:14.420
Look! That red planet of war is
now watching over our holy war!

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:17.390
It'll surely boost our soldiers' morale!

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:20.760
Atalantes, give them their
orders for this operation.

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.180
Attention all fleets!

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:27.310
We can assume that the
enemy will rally on the starway.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.360
Advance fleets, maintain your current speed.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:33.490
Rear fleets, deploy around the flagship.

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:36.280
Get to your battle stations immediately!

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:40.200
Because of the massive energy that
was released in the area with Nodos,

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:44.000
the previously-stable
starway is being distorted.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:47.210
No matter how you look at it
this is an emergency situation,

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:52.670
but those damn monkeys are
planning to charge with no plan whatsoever.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.460
Should we take action?

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:58.720
Not yet. Investigate the reason
for that abnormal change for now.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:03.430
Unless we have a strategy, we won't be
able to survive, even if we do seize authority.

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:08.940
Here it comes.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.440
What do we do about the Nodos?

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.820
We'll deal with the Tribe of Iron first.

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.320
It can't be...

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:32.590
Why? Why don't you resist, Karkinos?

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:33.880
Don't tell me this is

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:35.210
Madness...

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:39.890
Karkinos must be trying not to
get caught up in his madness

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:44.060
I must... I must go and stop him!

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:47.390
We still have one unwounded Nodos.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:51.100
There's no way Mehitak can stop him, Rom Ror!

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:04.530
I can't believe it...
To think I can't find you...

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:05.790
Age...

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:32.900
The Tribe of Iron's Nodos has gone mad.

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:35.650
This place is going to be in danger, too.

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:40.610
We must not let the Tribe of Iron
advance. They will destroy planets.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.320
Their existence puts this universe in danger.

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:17.480
What are you afraid of?
Break through it head-on!

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:20.860
There's no such word as "retreat"
in the Yunos royal family's vocabulary!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:24.070
Don't pull back! You must not pull back!

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:29.330
That's insane. They started the battle
without even waiting for the rescue units?

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:32.210
It was probably decided on
Meleagros' own authority.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:35.380
Age is fighting against the enemy Nodos,

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:38.550
but it sounds like they've
left him behind the fleet now.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:41.260
Can they be any more reckless?

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:47.720
Why do they fight so haphazardly?

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:52.430
At this rate, even the Earth
will turn into a battleground...

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:58.730
Dhianeila-sama, you have already
done enough for your brothers.

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:00.980
Aneasha?

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:03.700
Forgive me for being rude,
but I must tell you this.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:07.910
I can't imagine following
Meleagros-sama and Atalantes-sama

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:12.290
is what you really want to do right now.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:14.370
I know that.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:17.750
I can no longer support my brothers, who
have destroyed the planet of an ancient god,

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:24.550
and are on the verge of turning even
our homeland into a battlefield, but...

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:28.260
But if you stand up against them,

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:34.480
it could bring chaos to the Council,
after it's finally banded together?

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:36.600
Yes, Aneasha.

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:39.940
Your role ended when you brought
the last Nodos to the humans.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:46.070
All there is for you now is
to see how things develop.

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:48.240
No, that's not true at all!

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:54.290
Because there's no guarantee that the
last Nodos is going to be on your side.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:00.170
Age has chosen my brothers.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:07.050
That was the decision he made in
order to protect you, Dhianeila-sama.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:09.090
Do you think so?

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:16.020
All of a sudden, I stopped
sensing Age's presence.

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:20.060
Maybe he's rejected me.

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:30.660
From now on, many stars will be wiped
out and many paths will disappear.

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:36.660
But you can find the paths
for many people, Dhianeila.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:40.920
I don't even know how I
should find my own path...

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:47.550
Just follow your heart.
That's all we ask of you.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:50.090
I'm sure that's what Age wants, too.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:04.940
Where are the rear units?

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:07.150
Make the rear units charge ahead!

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:10.490
The enemy force has reached
them already, Your Highness!

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:14.120
Th-Then send all the remaining fleets!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:15.700
Big Brother.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.250
Don't get scared! Charge ahead!

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:20.670
Big Brother!
 What?!

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:26.170
Phobos has become the Tribe of
Bronze's nest. If we attack it...

00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:28.550
I know that! Ready the main cannon!

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:30.550
I'm picking up an energy
reading in direction 439!

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:33.090
Its numbers are extremely high!
 What?

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:53.910
Dhianeila-sama?

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:57.450
I just sensed Age's presence.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:04.000
What's the matter?

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:07.050
It's so terrifying...

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:26.610
Th-That's our Nodos!

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:29.320
Did he defeat the enemy Nodos?

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:46.290
There's been a change in the
satellite's orbit due to the impact!

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:47.790
It's going to crash into Mars!

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:51.510
Whoa... What amazing power!

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.660
Is he going to destroy
him along with the planet?

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.410
Karkinos...

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:40.890
It's going to be way over
the shield's durability limit!

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:44.100
Your Highness, please order all
the ships to withdraw immediately!

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:48.860
What are you talking about?
Our Nodos just destroyed the enemy's nest!

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:51.980
Come on, keep going!
Keep going alongside our Nodos!

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:56.700
If we keep going, this ship will be
destroyed by the effects of the Nodos' power!

00:12:56.780 --> 00:13:00.240
D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.980
Is that... madness?

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:33.570
This place is dangerous.

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:35.610
We won't be able to stop it.

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:43.080
That foolish sensation again...

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.700
We'll withdraw for now.

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:48.750
That Nodos will destroy
the Tribe of Iron for us.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:09.690
Mehitak! What are you doing?

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:15.400
I have to do it...

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.110
I have to!

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:21.110
Artemia!

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.750
Our advance guard has sustained
damage due to the high energy!

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:38.010
Wh-What's happening to you, our Nodos?

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:41.050
At this rate, it's going to hit us directly!

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:47.680
H-H-Hurry up and get us out of here!

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:49.730
We're not going to make it!

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:04.120
Wh-What happened?

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:08.120
A-A Nodos, Your Majesty!
There's another Nodos!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:12.500
That's the same monster that
destroyed the planet Huelgoat!

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:17.250
For us to be saved by the enemy
Nodos... I wonder exactly what happened.

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:22.010
How could I know that? Just send
all the information to the Argonaut!

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:23.340
Yes, ma'am.

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:27.510
Cripes... At this rate, even if
I seize authority from them,

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:29.560
there won't be any options left to us.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:50.700
Dhianeila-sama?

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:56.380
I was wrong, Aneasha.

00:15:56.460 --> 00:16:07.930
Age wouldn't choose any individual...
He just dedicates his heart to us all...

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:15.980
We must save Age.

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:20.320
This is the latest information from Nilval.

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:22.070
Does this mean that our
Nodos is going crazy on everyone,

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:24.900
regardless of which side they belong to?

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:29.240
There's more than fifty hours of lag time
before we receive the information from her.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:34.410
I wouldn't be surprised if her fleet has
already been destroyed along with Mars.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:40.210
Why don't you have faith in Age?
He's never even once attacked us before!

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:45.720
What if it's not Age, but the true
nature of the Hero within him?

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:51.140
At this rate, there's a possibility that
the Earth will be destroyed by the Nodos.

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:53.520
The hero of destruction, eh?

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:56.270
No.

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:00.900
Princess!

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:04.280
She came in person again...

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:06.280
Dhianeila-sama.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:08.740
I'll be fine.

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:15.040
He's the hope of humankind. No matter
what happens, you should never doubt him.

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.910
B-But

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:22.380
I will lead him, so that he won't
become the hero of destruction.

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:23.630
Princess...

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:24.960
So that means...

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:27.680
Will you come with me?

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:40.310
All of us have pledged our undying
loyalty to you. Please, give us your orders.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:44.360
We've been waiting so long
for this moment, Princess.

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:01.830
Three hundred hours have passed since
Mars turned into a battlefield.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:06.300
Mars escaped total destruction thanks
to the appearance of the enemy Nodos.

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:09.510
However, half of the fleet has been damaged

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:12.800
and we can't confirm the
condition of the rest of the fleet.

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:16.520
This ship is currently fighting
back separately from our allies,

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:18.520
while being pulled by
the gravity of the starway.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:22.650
Most likely the fleet will be completely
destroyed in less than a hundred hours.

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:25.860
It's all due to the incompetence
of the executive commander,

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:31.660
and the fact that I missed
the chance to seize command.

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:35.660
In the name of Lieutenant
General Nilval Nephew,

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:39.660
I counsel you to let the Argonaut be the
flagship of the remaining fleets in the rear,

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:42.960
and also to place Captain Mobeedo
of the Argonaut in command.

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:44.670
You got it!

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:49.340
Is that supposed to be your will, Nilval?

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:50.380
Mobeedo!

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:53.890
You'll regret it if you die now.

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:58.890
The time has come.
Our princess finally stood up!

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:00.020
So that means

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:03.060
Your plan to reorganize
the fleets has been accepted.

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:05.400
Not only that, far more of them
than we expected are assembling

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:07.860
under the control of the princess right now.

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:11.650
Planets Colonis and Orion are
also following the princess' orders.

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:14.910
Be happy, Nilval. No matter where you look,

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:17.870
you'll never find
reinforcements with morale this high!

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:21.080
We should be able to
rendezvous with you in twenty hours.

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:24.130
Until then, do whatever
you have to do to stay alive!

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:33.050
So, it's finally awoken... Our star...

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:35.720
Our homeland is right in front of us!

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.560
So keep moving forward!

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.390
The Earth is ours!

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:42.980
Glory to my name!

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:45.060
Wh-What is this about?

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:48.610
If only you'd had better
judgment than a heap of stardust,

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:52.110
we wouldn't have had to
take this much damage.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.450
Nilval!

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:56.160
If you don't want to disgrace your
names any more than you already have,

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:57.830
please do not resist.

00:19:57.910 --> 00:20:01.450
Th-This is a rebellion against the Council!

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:06.830
No, it's not. I only conveyed the message
to you on behalf of the Yunos royal family.

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:10.920
Dhianeila!

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:16.180
My brothers, please try to
understand my predicament.

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:18.050
How dare you!

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.810
You must not bring disgrace to our royal
family's name any more than you already have.

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:25.810
We destroyed the planet of an
ancient god, drained the corps,

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:32.490
and cruelly used the Nodos in
fights for the sake of humanity.

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:37.570
How could we tell the people
about this battle without shame?

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:41.160
How dare you speak of my
victory in such an insulting manner?

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:47.120
The Council is also suffering tremendous
shock over the damage caused by this incident.

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:50.000
As soon as this message reaches you,

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:54.840
the Humanity Federation's Calydonian
Fleet will be under my command.

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:56.340
As my first item of business,

00:20:56.430 --> 00:21:01.720
I order both of you to consign authority
to Lieutenant General Nilval right away.

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:06.600
Please follow the order, Your Highness.

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:37.050
Begin acquiring horoscopes.

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:39.390
All sails are on the route-sensing mode.

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:43.720
This journey shall be the
maiden voyage of the Argonaut!

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:47.850
Actually, this is the 87th voyage, Master.

00:21:47.940 --> 00:21:50.900
It's just a figure of speech, Bee.

00:21:50.980 --> 00:21:54.400
This is a journey led by a
maiden who's graceful, yet strong.

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:58.860
My heart is pounding harder for
this journey than any other before it.

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:02.240
Now, Argonaut, set sail!

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:06.410
Age!

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:34.150
Zutto mae kara kimi no koto shitteita kedo

00:22:34.230 --> 00:22:41.570
Konna kimochi mebaeru nante omowanakatta

00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:46.700
Masaka kimi ni koi suru nante

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:57.590
Nanige nai kaerimichi
yozora no hoshi wo miage nagara

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:10.430
Wazato toomawari shite
kimi no kata ni motarete aruku

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:21.530
Futari de ireba donna kotodemo
norikoeraresou to iu kimi no

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:26.910
Massugu na me wo mitsumete omou

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:33.460
Kimi wo aishiteru

00:23:36.750 --> 00:23:40.170
Shattering hopes and the despair of humanity.

00:23:40.260 --> 00:23:45.550
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 15: "When the Light Rains Down."
